# ── Legacy URLs from the old site ──────────────────────────────────────
# Search engines and AI crawlers still hold the old site's URLs (blog
# posts, sector pages, /public/ and /front/ asset paths) and were burning
# ~200 crawls/day on 404s. 301 them to the nearest live equivalent so
# crawlers index real content and legacy link equity transfers.
# Order matters: most specific rules first.
/public/blog/* /news.html 301
/blog/* /news.html 301
/blogs /news.html 301
/public/parcel /parcel-centres 301
/public/* / 301
/front/* / 301
/about-us / 301
/about-us/* / 301
/parcel /parcel-centres 301
/e-commerce-logistics /fulfilment-automation 301
/maintenance-support /products.html 301
